    27	 * identity row — this persona, however they currently behave. A run
    28	 * pins a version row — this persona, frozen exactly as they were when
    29	 * the simulation happened, so editing today never rewrites what an old result
    30	 * meant. Renames touch the identity row only; behavior lives in the version.
